{"id": "EUVD-2026-99259", "enisaUuid": "ddcaa606-c429-3539-997f-f557c0d202eb", "description": "Aureus ERP through 1.6.0 contains an authorization bypass vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to read unpublished draft blog posts via the customer-facing post view page. Attackers who know or guess a post slug can retrieve the full title, content, image, tags, author and publish date because PostResource skips authorization and ViewPost ignores is_published.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T18:50:05", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T15:57:41", "baseScore": 6.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@leediay/ryPaE-t9fl", "https://github.com/aureuserp/aureuserp/blob/v1.6.0/plugins/webkul/blogs/src/Filament/Customer/Resources/PostResource/Pages/ViewPost.php#L9-L24", "https://github.com/aureuserp/aureuserp/blob/v1.6.0/plugins/webkul/blogs/src/Filament/Customer/Resources/PostResource.php#L23", "https://github.com/aureuserp/aureuserp/releases/tag/v1.6.0", "https://github.com/aureuserp/aureuserp", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/aureus-erp-through-1.6.0-unpublished-blog-post-disclosure-via-direct-url"], "aliases": ["GHSA-mj62-84wx-6gp9", "CVE-2026-110218"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.36, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "55a38d04-9ee2-33fe-b48d-4a56b321b77e", "product": {"name": "Aureus ERP", "vendor": {"name": "Webkul"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.6.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "0e81fd20-af5f-3fa0-ae2d-466908b11ede", "vendor": {"name": "Webkul"}}], "isExploited": false}